---
component: bondStory
# A crew member's bond story: told once ever, at their talk, once Ilo's
# regard with them is high enough (and, for a later story, after the one
# before it).
params:
  who: speaker
  need: int
  prev: { type: string, default: "" }
  only: { type: string, default: "" }   # an extra condition, conjoined
beat:
  on: talk
  target: "npc.@who"
  once: user
  priority: 12   # under the story beats (quill 15-30, sefa 20-45), over the everyday talk (10)
  when: "user.bond[@who] >= @need && (@only)"
  after: "@prev"
---

## Bond

@narrator: {{@who}} makes room for Ilo without being asked.
::body
